          India's most trusted rooftop solar feasibility and government subsidy estimation platform. Empowering Indian homeowners, RWAs, and commercial establishments to transition to clean solar energy with transparent savings metrics.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-emerald-400 font-semibold bg-emerald-950/60 border border-emerald-800/60 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg w-fit">
          <span>⚡ 100% Client-Side Private Calculation</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Capacity Calculators Column -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
          Capacity Guides
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li>
            <a href="/1kw-solar-panel-cost-calculator" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">
              1 kW Solar Panel (₹30k Subsidy)
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/2kw-solar-panel-cost-calculator" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">
              2 kW Solar Panel (₹60k Subsidy)
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/3kw-solar-panel-cost-calculator" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors font-semibold text-emerald-300">
              3 kW Solar System (₹78k Subsidy)
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/pm-surya-ghar-subsidy-calculator" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">
              PM Surya Ghar Yojana Rules
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/sbi-solar-loan-emi-calculator" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors">
              SBI Solar Loan EMI Calculator
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- State DISCOMs Column -->
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
          State Calculators
        </h4>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li>
            <a href="/solar-calculator-rajasthan" class="text-slate-400 hover:text-emerald-400 transition-colors font-medium text-emerald-300">
