          <strong>SolarCalculatorIndia.com</strong> is an independent, non-governmental consumer education and clean technology research utility. We are <strong>NOT affiliated with, endorsed by, sponsored by, or operated by</strong> the Ministry of New and Renewable Energy (MNRE), the Government of India, State Nodal Agencies, or any power distribution utility (DISCOM).
        </p>
        <p class="mt-2">
          Calculations are simulated estimates based on benchmark turnkey costs, average state electricity tariffs, and central financial assistance guidelines under the <em>PM Surya Ghar: Muft Bijli Yojana</em>. Final subsidy disbursements, vendor pricing, and net-metering feasibility are strictly subject to technical survey and official approval by your respective DISCOM and the official National Portal: <a href="https://pmsuryaghar.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-emerald-400 underline hover:text-emerald-300">pmsuryaghar.gov.in</a>.
        </p>
